    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t28",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 459,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 112,
      "text": "the only place that builds a chain client, a store, or a provider client\ncaches construction across requests, so no connection pool is opened per request\nruns migrate() once per process\ndelivered as middleware, so c.var.deps is typed and a test mounts fakes\nholds ORGANIZATION_ID \"nymspace\" and REGISTRATION_CHAIN_ID 84532\nfive of its twelve fields are services; the rest is chain config and addresses",
      "originalText": "the only place that builds a chain client, a store, or a provider client\ncaches construction across requests, so no connection pool is opened per request\nruns migrate() once per process\ndelivered as middleware, so c.var.deps is typed and a test mounts fakes\nholds ORGANIZATION_ID \"nymspace\" and REGISTRATION_CHAIN_ID 84532\nfive of its twelve fields are services; the rest is chain config and addresses",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
