    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t40",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 681,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 168,
      "text": "records        readText \u00b7 writeText\nEAC grants     authorizeTextRole \u00b7 canSetText \u00b7 canDelegateText \u00b7 rolesFor\nroles read     resolverHasRoles \u00b7 resolverRolesAt \u00b7 registryHasRoles \u00b7 registryResource\ninspection     permissionsFor \u00b7 delegatedKeys\nregistry       registerSubname \u00b7 canRegister \u00b7 getSubregistry \u00b7 setSubregistry\nwiring         getResolver \u00b7 setResolver \u00b7 findOwner \u00b7 findTokenId\nplumbing       deployProxy \u00b7 waitForReceipt\n\ntakes a chain-client port and never holds key material; `as` picks which key signs",
      "originalText": "records        readText \u00b7 writeText\nEAC grants     authorizeTextRole \u00b7 canSetText \u00b7 canDelegateText \u00b7 rolesFor\nroles read     resolverHasRoles \u00b7 resolverRolesAt \u00b7 registryHasRoles \u00b7 registryResource\ninspection     permissionsFor \u00b7 delegatedKeys\nregistry       registerSubname \u00b7 canRegister \u00b7 getSubregistry \u00b7 setSubregistry\nwiring         getResolver \u00b7 setResolver \u00b7 findOwner \u00b7 findTokenId\nplumbing       deployProxy \u00b7 waitForReceipt\n\ntakes a chain-client port and never holds key material; `as` picks which key signs",
      "fontSize": 15,
