    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t64",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 1181,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 168,
      "text": "searchAgents \u00b7 agentProfile \u00b7 indexingHead \u00b7 subgraphId \u00b7 provenance\nsearchAgent0 \u00b7 searchAgent0Cached\n\nqueries the live Agent0 subgraph through The Graph Gateway\ncarries feedback(first: 100) and validations(first: 100) in the query\nnormalisation preserves absence, so a missing endpoint is never read as a zero\nprovenance records which endpoint and chain answered\nAgent0ProviderError becomes a 502, because \"none matched\" and \"could not ask\"\nare different answers and one renders an outage as an empty market",
      "originalText": "searchAgents \u00b7 agentProfile \u00b7 indexingHead \u00b7 subgraphId \u00b7 provenance\nsearchAgent0 \u00b7 searchAgent0Cached\n\nqueries the live Agent0 subgraph through The Graph Gateway\ncarries feedback(first: 100) and validations(first: 100) in the query\nnormalisation preserves absence, so a missing endpoint is never read as a zero\nprovenance records which endpoint and chain answered\nAgent0ProviderError becomes a 502, because \"none matched\" and \"could not ask\"\nare different answers and one renders an outage as an empty market",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
