      "text": "wallets   createWallet \u00b7 getWallet \u00b7 listWallets \u00b7 setWalletPolicies\npolicy    createAmountPolicy \u00b7 getPolicyLimit \u00b7 updateAmountPolicy\nmoney     sendPayment\n\nimplements PrivyWalletPort\nreads the live spend limit rather than a recorded copy of it\nnormalises a policy rejection into application state instead of discarding it",
