    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t100",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 1960,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 168,
      "text": "agents      upsertAgent \u00b7 getAgent \u00b7 getAgentBySlug \u00b7 listAgents \u00b7 setProvisioning\norg         upsertOrganization \u00b7 getOrganization\nsnapshots   putIdentitySnapshot \u00b7 putGraphSnapshot \u00b7 putFinancialAuthority + getters\nactivity    recordEvent \u00b7 resolveEvent \u00b7 listActivity\n\nauthority for nothing but labels, provisioning progress, and the log\nALLOWED_COLUMNS is checked against information_schema, so a new column is a\ndeliberate edit; Snapshot<T> is branded and NOT NULL fetched_at, so a cached\nvalue can never reach the interface pretending to be a live read",
      "originalText": "agents      upsertAgent \u00b7 getAgent \u00b7 getAgentBySlug \u00b7 listAgents \u00b7 setProvisioning\norg         upsertOrganization \u00b7 getOrganization\nsnapshots   putIdentitySnapshot \u00b7 putGraphSnapshot \u00b7 putFinancialAuthority + getters\nactivity    recordEvent \u00b7 resolveEvent \u00b7 listActivity\n\nauthority for nothing but labels, provisioning progress, and the log\nALLOWED_COLUMNS is checked against information_schema, so a new column is a\ndeliberate edit; Snapshot<T> is branded and NOT NULL fetched_at, so a cached\nvalue can never reach the interface pretending to be a live read",
