    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t112",
      "x": 86,
      "y": 2238,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 112,
      "text": "getActivity(weeks?) \u00b7 REVALIDATE_SECONDS 60\nREPO_OWNER \u00b7 REPO_NAME \u00b7 REPO_BRANCH from env, default musashi0x/nymspace\n\ncounts real days from real commits, badges what GitHub reports verified\nserves /v1/github/activity and the landing page's server render from one place\nits own Hono instance with no DepsEnv, so it mounts no dependencies at all",
      "originalText": "getActivity(weeks?) \u00b7 REVALIDATE_SECONDS 60\nREPO_OWNER \u00b7 REPO_NAME \u00b7 REPO_BRANCH from env, default musashi0x/nymspace\n\ncounts real days from real commits, badges what GitHub reports verified\nserves /v1/github/activity and the landing page's server render from one place\nits own Hono instance with no DepsEnv, so it mounts no dependencies at all",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
