    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t116",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2390,
      "width": 1200,
      "height": 37,
      "text": "Only the Store card is dashed, and that is the arrangement in one mark: every other card answers for\nsomething it alone owns, so a handler wanting that answer has exactly one place to ask.",
